  "description": "DRIT.Pdf is a pure-managed, cross-platform .NET library for creating, reading, and manipulating PDF documents. It offers comprehensive PDF capabilities including AcroForms, digital signatures (PKCS#12, PKCS#11, PAdES), encryption, a full annotation hierarchy, tagged PDFs and PDF/UA, PDF/A and PDF/X conformance writing, portfolios, document comparison, and image conversion — built on a clean-room PDF 1.7/2.0 implementation with minimal NuGet dependencies.",
